OL,3,ATwelve killed in attack on airport in
OL,4,ASaudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 people have been killed and
OL,7,F309 injured in an attack on an airport
OL,8,Fin the Saudi capital Riyadh, local
OL,9,Fauthorities say, days after Yemen's
OL,10,FHouthis claimed similar strikes.
OL,12,FThe deaths included four Saudis, two
OL,13,Fpeople from Bangladesh and one person
OL,14,Feach from the US, Jordan, Palestine,
OL,15,FSyria, Sudan and Egypt, the Saudi civil
OL,16,Faviation authority said. Operations at
OL,17,FKing Khalid International Airport have
OL,18,Fbeen suspended.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
